accept_76201_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >If you want to master martial arts, you must learn from nature. You can meditate and contemplate to see if you can gain any insights. </font>
accept_76202_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Within the Tianya Haige</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >, constant training is necessary. Go and complete a trial.</font>
accept_76203_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You have traveled a long way to come to Tianya Haige to seek apprenticeship and learn. Your determination and courage are admirable.</font>
accept_76209_1=(Seeing you approach, try to remain calm and smile) Young one, you have returned...
accept_76218_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >This</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >should</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >be the stones piled on the merchant ship that the Pearl Girl took back then!</font>
accept_76230_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Hit me...kill me...</font>
accept_76231_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >To join the sect, you need to pass the assessment first.</font>
accept_76232_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >{@0:}, </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have a task for you to complete.</font>
accept_76233_1=
accept_76296_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Are you sure you want to betray Tianya Haige?</font>
accept_76297_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are already a qualified disciple of Tianya Haige, do you want to go out and explore?</font>
accept_76298_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >You are already a qualified disciple of Tianya Haige, do you want to return to Kunlun?</font>
accept_76299_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The sea turtles are being disturbed by the monkeys, please help them!</font>
accept_76300_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Pass the test of the guards to be able to cultivate near the Fountain of Youth.</font>
complete_76201=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I hope you've learned something from this exercise. </font>
complete_76202=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Well done. Here's the reward for you. </font>
complete_76203=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Join Tianya Haige, the first skill is not martial arts, but learning tea ceremony and serving the finest tea.</font>
complete_76206=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Senior brother,</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >if it weren't for the two herbs in the pharmacy running out, you wouldn't have to go through such hardship to gather them.</font>
complete_76207=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Is there any</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >abnormality</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >?</font>
complete_76217=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Did you find those stones?</font>
complete_76221=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >The peaceful years are priceless, it's time to organize a gathering event.</font>
complete_76231=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >From this moment on, you are a disciple of Tianya Haige!</font>
complete_76242=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >From this moment on, you are a disciple of Tianya Haige!</font>
complete_76248=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >From this moment on, you are a disciple of </font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Tianya Haige</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >!</font>
complete_76296=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I understand your thoughts, but if you betray the sect, you will be hunted down by us. You will have no connection with the Tianya Haige, do you still insist on betraying the sect?</font>
complete_76297=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Come visit us often.</font>
complete_76298=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >It's time for you to go. Take care.</font>
complete_76299=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Well done. Here's the reward for you. </font>
complete_76300=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Well done. Here's the reward for you. </font>
context_76201=Go to the meditation area and complete a period of contemplation, and truly understand nature!
context_76202=Go to the Tianya Haige scene and follow <a href="findnpc_new,school25,newmp_gujtyhg_002" style="HLStype1">Rui Xing</a>'s instructions to complete a trial at the Haige.
context_76203=Upon entering the Tianya Haige, go to meet the sect leader and learn about the relevant matters of the Haige.
context_76204=Follow Elder Yunhen's teachings on the art of making high-quality matcha.
context_76205=Go to meet Elder Qingchuan.
context_76206=There are stranded ships on the beach, go and take a look.
context_76207=These three women are all dressed in luxurious clothing, carefully inquire about their backgrounds.
context_76208=These three women are very suspicious, carefully investigate their identities.
context_76209=The scenery at Tianya Haige is picturesque, and the newly arrived Jade Rabbit enjoys the beautiful scenery.
context_76210=The Jade Rabbit and Elder Yunhen seem to have a secret that cannot be revealed. They investigate suspicious areas one by one and discover the truth.
context_76211=Upon receiving a message from the three princes of the Tartars, Saihan, the eldest disciple, informs the master.
context_76212=The court surrounds Tianya Haige and tries to find a solution to the crisis.
context_76213=Plan to return the military map to General Huang and bid farewell to Saihan.
context_76214=Inform the Lord of the Pavilion that General Huang and Saihan are leaving.
context_76215=Listen to the Lord's story of the past and the grudges of the previous generation.
context_76216=Elder Yunhen is desperate and wants to end her life. Make a promise to recreate the wonders within three days.
context_76217=After thorough analysis and investigation, recreate the illusion from the past.
context_76218=Put two types of stones into the fire and attempt to recreate the illusion.
context_76219=Now that you have found a way to recreate the wonders of the past, go and report to the sect leader and elders.
context_76220=Explain the principle of recreating the wonders in detail to the sect leader.
context_76221=Listen to the sect leader's sincere guidance.
context_76230=In broad daylight, there are people who dare to bully defenseless elderly! This is unacceptable!
context_76231=Pass the assessment and join the sect.
context_76232=The sect leader suddenly summoned you, hurry to the Jade Void Hall.
context_76233=The sect leader orders you to patrol the Kunlun area during the seclusion, and seek advice from Senior Brother Cao Yi'an if you encounter any problems.
context_76234=A group of suspicious people have appeared at the foot of the mountain, be careful and investigate their intentions.
context_76235=The leader is right in front of you, ask him why he has the items in the package.
context_76236=Just as you were about to take action, Senior Brother Cao Yi'an suddenly appeared. Could it be that he is afraid you are not a match for him?
context_76237=The sect leader is not in seclusion yet, but is catching up with old friend Wang Fuhai in the Jade Void Hall. He summons you to go there.
context_76238=Wang Fuhai, asks you to help him find a few things. If you can successfully complete the task, he will forgive you. (Talk to Wang Fuhai and go to the top of Kunlun Mountain)
context_76239=The things that Wang Fuhai wanted have already been collected. Hurry and give them to him.
context_76240=Do the final test with Wang Fuhai (If you leave the top of Kunlun Mountain, you can talk to <a href="findnpc_new,school24,npc_ty_dy_12" style="HLStype1">Wang Fuhai</a> and go)
context_76241=You have already defeated the inner demons. Return to Kunlun and find Senior Wang.
context_76242=You have been practicing martial arts in the mountains for a long time. It's time to go down the mountain and gain some experience! Say goodbye to the master first.
context_76243=Take care of the old man. He must have been seriously injured by the thugs. See if you can find a doctor to help him.
context_76244=I heard that this old doctor is a famous physician in Jinling. I wonder if he can cure Old Wang.
context_76245=Old Wang hopes that you can bring the colorful pearl to his daughter in the South Sea.
context_76246=Go to the South Sea with the boat captain and find the Tianyou Island to fulfill Old Wang's wish.
context_76247=It turns out that the Wang family is in such a tragic situation, so let's bury these colorful pearls next to Wang's wife and daughter.
context_76248=It turns out that there is a hidden sect called Tianya Haige on Tianyou Island, and Qinghe is one of its disciples. He intends to invite you to Tianya Haige.
context_76296=After leaving Tianya Haige, there is no longer any connection with it.
context_76297=You have confirmed to graduate from Shenji Camp and return to jianghu.
context_76298=You have decided to leave and return to Kunlun.
context_76299=Recently, there are many sea turtles returning to the sea at the beach of Tianya Haige, but some mischievous monkeys always secretly catch the sea turtles. Protect the sea turtles and let them return to the sea.
context_76300=The Fountain of Youth is a unique scenery of Tianya Haige. Practicing near the Fountain of Youth can help calm the mind, but one must pass a test to be able to practice there.
menu_76201_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I understand. I'm on my way.</font>
menu_76202_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >All right.</font>
menu_76203_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Greetings master. I have longed for the Tianya Haige for a long time.</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Now, finally, my wish has been fulfilled.</font>
menu_76209_1=<font face="Default" color="#ff0019" >(Struggling to contain the shock in my heart, I remain calm on the surface)</font><font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I didn't realize we had been together for so long, and it's already late. You have just recovered from a serious illness, so it's best to go back and rest.</font>
menu_76218_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I must carefully study these stones, hoping that my deductions are correct!</font>
menu_76230_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Sir?</font>
menu_76231_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will go and try. </font>
menu_76232_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I wonder what the task is?</font>
menu_76233_1=
menu_76296_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes.</font>
menu_76297_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes.</font>
menu_76298_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Yes.</font>
menu_76299_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >All right.</font>
menu_76300_1=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I understand.</font>
