submit_76201=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you, I have indeed.</font>
submit_76202=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you.</font>
submit_76203=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please enlighten me.</font>
submit_76206=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Saving lives and helping the injured is only natural. The herbs has already been collected, so go and make the medicine quickly.</font>
submit_76207=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Of the three women, two could not understand our language and must be foreigners, while the other one, although able to communicate, seemed more like someone who has lived in the borderlands for a long time. Elder, this matter is of great importance, so I must report it to the head of the sect.</font>
submit_76217=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please take a look at these gold, silver, and precious stones, grandmother.</font>
submit_76221=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Please take your time to plan, I will take my leave first.</font>
submit_76231=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Joining the sect (completed).</font>
submit_76242=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Entering Tianya Haige (completed).</font>
submit_76248=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Tianya Haige entrance (completed).</font>
submit_76296=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I have made up my mind. Please allow my wishes.</font>
submit_76297=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >I will. Take care.</font>
submit_76298=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Take care.</font>
submit_76299=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you.</font>
submit_76300=<font face="Default" color="#ffffff" >Thank you.</font>
